# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Form delivery — configure ONE of the two options below before launch.
#
# With neither set, development logs submissions to the server console and
# PRODUCTION REFUSES THEM with a 503 that tells the sender to email us instead.
# That is deliberate: silently accepting an enquiry nobody will read is worse
# than failing loudly. See lib/deliver.ts.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Option 1 — POST every submission as JSON to a URL you control
# (Zapier, Make, n8n, a Google Sheet webhook, or your own API).
ZIDI_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Option 2 — email the team directly via Resend (https://resend.com).
# All three are needed together.
RESEND_API_KEY=
ZIDI_NOTIFY_EMAIL=hello@zeedeelearn.com
ZIDI_FROM_EMAIL="Zidi website <website@yourdomain.com>"
